### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### Create entry
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "habit": "lectura",
  "mood": "good",
  "minutes": 30,
  "note": "Capítulo 3 — Clean Code"
}

### List
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/entries?limit=20

### Stats
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/stats
